ky  News West Yorkshire  well I should just tell you that in the  last hour a major incident has been  declared in Derbyshire where 12 fire  crews are dealing with a fire in fields  and around a farm are 50 properties in  that area have been evacuated in  Creswell with local residents gathering  at uh the villages Events Center that  fire in Derbyshire  so across this desperately dry land the  inevitable has now happened and much of  the country is now officially under  drought restrictions as we enter another  weekend of baking temperatures millions  of people in this country are now being  asked to change the way they live in  terms of water usage how long it will  last no one knows that depends on the  weather on nature and what it has in  store for us we leave you now with a  look at how this summer of unrelenting  heat has changed the face of Britain  foreign  [Music]  [Music]  foreign
 

